# Preserved simulator evidence — keep byte-exact.
#
# These files are verbatim XSim output, and their SHA256 hashes are recorded in
# the PROVENANCE.md beside them as the evidence of record. The -text attribute
# disables Git's end-of-line conversion for them, so the bytes checked out are
# byte-for-byte the bytes the simulator emitted, whatever core.autocrlf is set
# to on the machine doing the checkout. Without it, a checkout under
# core.autocrlf=true would rewrite line endings and the files would no longer
# hash to the recorded values.
#
# Scoped deliberately to these paths only: the rest of the repository keeps
# Git's normal text handling.

# STALL=0 baseline — hls/reports/standalone_rtl_sim/PROVENANCE.md
hls/reports/standalone_rtl_sim/baseline_complete.txt -text
hls/reports/standalone_rtl_sim/baseline_partial.txt -text
hls/reports/standalone_rtl_sim/xelab_verify.txt -text

# STALL=1 backpressure stress — hls/reports/standalone_rtl_stress/PROVENANCE.md
hls/reports/standalone_rtl_stress/stress_complete.txt -text
hls/reports/standalone_rtl_stress/stress_scout.txt -text
hls/reports/standalone_rtl_stress/xelab_stress.txt -text
